       "$N" prefix; Favor: "{0} favor". {0} = formatted number. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.Trade.Price.Silver>${0}</RimWorldAccess.Trade.Price.Silver>
  <RimWorldAccess.Trade.Price.Favor>{0} честі</RimWorldAccess.Trade.Price.Favor>

